        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kikamanywa boona abaikaraga Yerusaalemu; nikyo omusiri ogu, omu ngambo yabo, gwayetiirwe Akelidama, amakuru gaakyo: Omusiri gw'Esagama.] ",
          "type": "text",
