        },
        {
          "text": "“Nahabweki tusemeriire kukoma omu ha basaija aba twagendaga nabo ebiro byona MUKAMA Yesu ebi yamazire na itwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.21",
